        "bookingUrl": "https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/spinifex.fr.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCDHNlYXJjaF9kZXJieUgNWARoTYgBAZgBM7gBF8gBDNgBA-gBAfgBAYgCAagCAbgCtvS10QbAAgHSAiQwMmIwY2JiNS04NjFkLTQ3NGYtYTViZi1hMTA2OTUzOTM1ZTjYAgHgAgE&ucfs=1&arphpl=1&checkin=2027-01-15&checkout=2027-01-16&group_adults=2&req_adults=2&no_rooms=1&group_children=0&req_children=0&hpos=1&hapos=1&sr_order=distance_from_search&nflt=review_score%3D70&srpvid=bb756e5be7d702fe&srepoch=1781365304&all_sr_blocks=86336101_373712275_0_0_0&highlighted_blocks=86336101_373712275_0_0_0&matching_block_id=86336101_373712275_0_0_0&sr_pri_blocks=86336101_373712275_0_0_0__28500&from=searchresults",
        "description_fr": "Situé à 10 minutes à pied de l'hôpital de Derby, le Spinifex Hotel propose une piscine extérieure, un restaurant et des transferts gratuits depuis et vers l'aéroport de Derby. Il propose des studios indépendants dotés d'une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite et d'un balcon privé.\nLe Spinifex Hotel Derby se trouve à 20 minutes à pied de la jetée de Derby, réputée pour la pêche, le bateau et les magnifiques couchers de soleil. L'aéroport de Derby est accessible en 15 minutes de route.\nLes studios climatisés disposent d'une kitchenette avec un four micro-ondes. Chaque studio dispose également d'un lave-linge et d'un coin salon avec une télévision par câble à écran plat. La salle de bains est pourvue d'articles de toilette gratuits.",
        "description_en": "Boasting an outdoor pool, a restaurant and free transfers to and from Derby Airport, Spinifex Hotel is 10 minutes’ walk from the Derby Hospital. It offers self-contained studios with free Wi-Fi and a private balcony.\nSpinifex Hotel Derby is 20 minutes’ walk from the Derby Jetty, popular for fishing, boating and beautiful sunsets. Derby Airport is a 15-minute drive away.\nThe air-conditioned studios have a kitchenette with a microwave. Each studio also has laundry facilities and a seating area with a flat-screen TV and cable channels. The bathroom comes with free toiletries.\nThe restaurant specialises in steaks, pork belly, oysters, salmon and vegetarian options. The bar is the perfect place for a casual drink, and offers frequent evening entertainment including karaoke and DJs.",
        "description_es": "El Spinifex Hotel se encuentra a 10 minutos a pie del hospital de Derby y cuenta con piscina al aire libre, restaurante y servicio gratuito de enlace con el aeropuerto de Derby. Ofrece estudios independientes con conexión Wi-Fi gratuita y balcón privado.\nEl Spinifex Hotel Derby se encuentra a 20 minutos a pie del embarcadero de Derby, donde se puede pescar, navegar y disfrutar de hermosas puestas de sol. El aeropuerto de Derby está a 15 minutos en coche.\nLos estudios disponen de aire acondicionado y zona de cocina con microondas. También incluyen lavadora y zona de estar con TV de pantalla plana por cable. El baño incluye artículos de aseo gratuitos.\nEl restaurante está especializado en carnes, barriga de cerdo, ostras, salmón y opciones vegetarianas.",
        "description_pt": "Boasting an outdoor pool, a restaurant and free transfers to and from Derby Airport, Spinifex Hotel is 10 minutes’ walk from the Derby Hospital. It offers self-contained studios with free Wi-Fi and a private balcony.\nSpinifex Hotel Derby is 20 minutes’ walk from the Derby Jetty, popular for fishing, boating and beautiful sunsets. Derby Airport is a 15-minute drive away.\nThe air-conditioned studios have a kitchenette with a microwave. Each studio also has laundry facilities and a seating area with a flat-screen TV and cable channels. The bathroom comes with free toiletries.\nThe restaurant specialises in steaks, pork belly, oysters, salmon and vegetarian options. The bar is the perfect place for a casual drink, and offers frequent evening entertainment including karaoke and DJs.",
